units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/cut 3.0
kspace_style none
dielectric 1.000000
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style fourier
improper_style cvff
special_bonds amber
pair_modify mix arithmetic
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
read_data eq1.data
